                url  :  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : '''Abhaneri''' &amp;mdash; you can arrange transport to this village, which contains an impressive ancient stepwell and a beautiful 9th-century temple &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
                <styleUrl>#169</styleUrl>
