                description  : '''Bikaner''' &amp;mdash; a city in the Thar Desert; though less visited than Jaisalmer, it is home to several important sites such as Bikaner Fort (Junagarh Fort), Laxmi Niwas Palace and Shivbari Temple &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
